{
  "series_title": "Black Clover",
  "research_status": "COMPLETE — all 170 episodes of Black Clover classified canon/filler/mixed, though with a real, disclosed confidence gap on the 'mixed' category that this project's other shows don't have. The 17-episode pure-filler list (29, 66, 68, 82, 123-125, 131, 134-135, 142-148) is corroborated by two independently-fetched sources (QuoteTheAnime, CBR) agreeing exactly, including the specific 148 boundary on the Elf Reincarnation arc's filler run. Episode 149 is the one genuinely contested boundary case — see its own status_note. Several other candidate 'mixed' episodes were checked across sources (2, 3, 8, 9, 12, 30, 67, 69, 85, 86, 88, 130) but the sources disagreed with each other, and in one case (joinkaminari.com) with itself, on which specific episodes qualify — rather than guess, those are all recorded as plain canon here, and only episode 102 (the one candidate every checked source that mentioned mixed episodes at all agreed on) is recorded as mixed, itself only backed by one directly-fetched source. This is a meaningfully lower-confidence 'mixed' classification than this project's other shows, which is why it's spelled out here rather than left implicit. No episode titles included — left for the existing backfill_episode_titles_from_anilist.py (#73) pass, same as Dragon Ball Z/Super. Complete, gap-free, non-overlapping coverage of 1-170 confirmed before writing this file.",
